<view class="page-shell page-shell--secondary edit-page">
  <app-topbar title="编辑资料" subtitle="管理你的显示资料" fallback-tab="profile" />

  <view class="edit-card matte-card">
    <view class="field-label">昵称</view>
    <view class="nickname-field">
      <input
        class="nickname-input"
        type="nickname"
        value="{{nickname}}"
        maxlength="12"
        placeholder="请输入昵称"
        bindinput="onNicknameInput"
      />
      <text class="nickname-count">{{nickname.length}} / 12</text>
    </view>
    <text class="field-note">昵称会显示在首页和个人中心。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-heading edit-section-heading">
    <view class="section-title">选择内置头像</view>
    <text class="section-note">不上传临时图片</text>
  </view>
  <view class="avatar-card matte-card">
    <view
      wx:for="{{avatarOptions}}"
      wx:key="id"
      class="avatar-option {{avatarUrl === item.url ? 'avatar-option--selected' : ''}}"
      data-avatar-url="{{item.url}}"
      aria-label="选择{{item.label}}头像"
      bindtap="onAvatarTap"
    >
      <image class="avatar-option__image" src="{{item.url}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="avatar-option__label">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{avatarUrl === item.url}}" class="avatar-option__check">
        <t-icon name="check" size="24rpx" />
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-note matte-card">
    <t-icon name="lock-on" size="30rpx" />
    <text>内置头像不会上传；微信头像会上传至云存储，随账号同步，并会在注销账号时清理。</text>
  </view>

  <button class="save-button" bindtap="onSave">保存资料</button>
</view>
